Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Infiltrator-Projects/Software

Package: infiltrator-software
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: unified Infiltrator software manager and updater
 Infiltrator Software provides one graphical surface for software discovery,
 installed applications, updates, system components, repositories, history
 and repair. The first backend targets APT/.deb while keeping the application
 architecture package-manager-neutral.
